1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:14,040
What mistake was made?
出了什么差错？

2
00:00:14,040 --> 00:00:16,090
What mistake was made?
出了什么差错？

3
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:22,320
The great racing driver, Sir Malcolm Campbell,
伟大的赛车手马尔科姆·坎贝尔爵士

4
00:00:22,610 --> 00:00:27,660
was the first man to drive at over 300 miles per hour.
是第一个以每小时300多英里的速度驾车的人。

5
00:00:28,920 --> 00:00:37,690
He set up a new world record in September 1935 at Bonneville Salt Flats, Utah.
1935年9月，他在犹他州的博纳维尔盐滩创造了一项新的世界纪录。

6
00:00:39,310 --> 00:00:45,300
Bluebird, the car he was driving, had been specially built for him.
他驾驶的“蓝鸟”牌汽车是专门为他制造的。

7
00:00:46,170 --> 00:00:52,740
It was over 30 feet in length and had a 2, 500-horsepower engine.
车长30多英尺，装有一台2,500马力的发动机。

8
00:00:53,910 --> 00:00:59,800
Although Campbell reached a speed of over 304 miles per hour,
虽然坎贝尔达到了每小时304英里的速度，

9
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:07,680
he had great difficulty in controlling the car because a tyre burst during the first run.
但他很难控制汽车，因为在第一次跑时一个轮胎爆了。

10
00:01:09,160 --> 00:01:10,790
After his attempt,
尝试结束后，

11
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:18,790
Campbell was disappointed to learn that his average speed had been 299 miles per hour.
坎贝尔失望地得知他的平均时速是299英里。

12
00:01:19,730 --> 00:01:25,300
However, a few days later, he was told that a mistake had been made.
然而几天后，他被告知出了一个差错。

13
00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:30,330
His average speed had been 301 miles per hour.
他的平均时速是301英里。

14
00:01:31,670 --> 00:01:38,780
Since that time, racing drivers have reached speeds over 600 miles an hour.
从那时起，赛车手的时速已超过600英里。

15
00:01:39,640 --> 00:01:48,870
Following in his father's footsteps many years later, Sir Malcolm's son, Donald, also set up a world record.
多年以后，马尔科姆的儿子唐纳德步父亲的后尘，也创造了一项世界纪录。

16
00:01:48,890 --> 00:01:54,150
Like his father, he was driving a car called Bluebird.
和父亲一样，他驾驶的也是一辆叫“蓝鸟”的汽车。
